---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read our privacy policy. Fall Asleep is completely private, local-only, and tracks absolutely no user data.">
  <main class="page-container">
    <header class="page-header">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="page-content">
      <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> July 2026</p>
      <p>At Fall Asleep, your privacy is our absolute highest priority. We have designed this application to be entirely self-contained and local to your device.</p>
      
      <h2>1. Data Collection</h2>
      <p><strong>We do not collect any personal data.</strong> There are no user accounts, no login screens, and no tracking scripts. We do not use analytics tools to monitor how you use the app.</p>
      
      <h2>2. Data Storage</h2>
      <p>Any information you generate while using Fall Asleep (including your journal entries, sleep check-ins, and usage preferences) is stored <strong>strictly locally</strong> in your web browser using standard web storage technologies.</p>
      <p>This data never leaves your device. It is never transmitted to our servers (because we don't have any), and it is never shared with third parties.</p>
      
      <h2>3. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
      <p>We do not use tracking cookies or third-party advertising scripts. The application functions entirely without requiring intrusive monitoring.</p>
      
      <h2>4. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>If we make any changes to our privacy practices, we will update this policy. However, our core commitment to keeping your data 100% local and private will never change.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

